+
+`configs/wulai_all9.yaml` reuses the existing 2,043 already-undistorted
+`vid_*/frame_*.jpg` keyframes; it performs no image undistortion or extraction.
+It uses Pi3 poses/intrinsics, MegaLoc retrieval, MoGe-3 ViT-L depth,
