+Before running, copy `cameras.txt`, `images.txt` and `points3D.txt` from the
+prior run's `intrinsics_seed` into `results/wulai_intrinsics_seed/`.
+The config records the machine-local checkpoint, keyframe and worker paths.
+`num_workers: 0` avoids parallel original-resolution star loads: the initial
+two-worker smoke run was killed by the system RAM OOM killer before its first
+star completed. Run inside a memory-limited systemd scope on shared machines.
